{"4130950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Magnifikos", "steam_appid": 4130950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎪 <strong>MAGNIFIKOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An insane 2D <strong>beat’em up</strong> packed with <strong>pixel art mayhem and breathtaking action!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ <strong>Grab your ticket for the most dangerous show in town!</strong><br>You control Vic, a tough-as-nails soldier sent to destroy a bizarre and violent circus that has taken over the streets of Central City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130950/extras/029705b35d3bd2a2b49a54f084fdba58.poster.avif?t=1768255687\" width=1170 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130950/extras/029705b35d3bd2a2b49a54f084fdba58.webm?t=1768255687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 <strong>PURE, UNFILTERED BRAWL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Magnifikos</i> brings back the <strong>nostalgia of classic 2D beat’em ups</strong> with <strong>modern fluidity and explosive combat</strong>. Dodge, combo, and smash your way through hordes of enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ Smooth gameplay with melee and ranged combat<br>✔️ Fast-paced side-scrolling action across multiple stages<br>✔️ Agile movement and strategic attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130950/extras/3a8201e4c65bde3410520e02e101161a.apng?t=1768255687\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130950/extras/3a8201e4c65bde3410520e02e101161a.poster.avif?t=1768255687\" class=\"bb_img\" width=186 height=195 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💥 <strong>PICK YOUR WEAPON, PICK YOUR STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of <strong>unique weapons</strong>, each with its own attack style. Adapt, improvise, and dominate every fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Melee and ranged weapons<br>🎭 Special amulets that unlock unique abilities<br>🕹️ Responsive controls for seamless attacking, dashing, and dodging</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130950/extras/e075684f8ae30b6e80c37fe6fa4d6396.apng?t=1768255687\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130950/extras/e075684f8ae30b6e80c37fe6fa4d6396.poster.avif?t=1768255687\" class=\"bb_img\" width=186 height=195 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 <strong>WITH FAITH IN THE AMULET, EVEN THE DEVIL FALLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face brutal bosses, use the environment to your advantage, and uncover <strong>interactive traps and items</strong> that make every run unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧪 Consumable and equipable items with diverse effects<br>👹 Electrifying boss fights<br>🎮 High replayability with multiple combat styles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130950/extras/5ecf8254889839ceb5ea138e7f0bbd91.apng?t=1768255687\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130950/extras/5ecf8254889839ceb5ea138e7f0bbd91.poster.avif?t=1768255687\" class=\"bb_img\" width=180 height=255 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎨 <strong>OLD-SCHOOL FLAVOR, FRESH CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world inspired by <strong>retro classics</strong>, filled with decaying urban landscapes and sinister circus freaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖼️ Vibrant pixel art<br>🎡 Dark, circus-themed atmosphere<br>🎶 Immersive soundtrack that cranks up the intensity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130950/extras/283c1fba1648455797a096c784d8962b.apng?t=1768255687\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130950/extras/283c1fba1648455797a096c784d8962b.poster.avif?t=1768255687\" class=\"bb_img\" width=186 height=195 /></picture></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎪 <strong>MAGNIFIKOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An insane 2D <strong>beat’em up</strong> packed with <strong>pixel art mayhem and breathtaking action!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ <strong>Grab your ticket for the most dangerous show in town!</strong><br>You control Vic, a tough-as-nails soldier sent to destroy a bizarre and violent circus that has taken over the streets of Central City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130950/extras/029705b35d3bd2a2b49a54f084fdba58.poster.avif?t=1768255687\" width=1170 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130950/extras/029705b35d3bd2a2b49a54f084fdba58.webm?t=1768255687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 <strong>PURE, UNFILTERED BRAWL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Magnifikos</i> brings back the <strong>nostalgia of classic 2D beat’em ups</strong> with <strong>modern fluidity and explosive combat</strong>. Dodge, combo, and smash your way through hordes of enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ Smooth gameplay with melee and ranged combat<br>✔️ Fast-paced side-scrolling action across multiple stages<br>✔️ Agile movement and strategic attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130950/extras/3a8201e4c65bde3410520e02e101161a.apng?t=1768255687\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130950/extras/3a8201e4c65bde3410520e02e101161a.poster.avif?t=1768255687\" class=\"bb_img\" width=186 height=195 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💥 <strong>PICK YOUR WEAPON, PICK YOUR STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of <strong>unique weapons</strong>, each with its own attack style. Adapt, improvise, and dominate every fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Melee and ranged weapons<br>🎭 Special amulets that unlock unique abilities<br>🕹️ Responsive controls for seamless attacking, dashing, and dodging</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130950/extras/e075684f8ae30b6e80c37fe6fa4d6396.apng?t=1768255687\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130950/extras/e075684f8ae30b6e80c37fe6fa4d6396.poster.avif?t=1768255687\" class=\"bb_img\" width=186 height=195 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 <strong>WITH FAITH IN THE AMULET, EVEN THE DEVIL FALLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face brutal bosses, use the environment to your advantage, and uncover <strong>interactive traps and items</strong> that make every run unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧪 Consumable and equipable items with diverse effects<br>👹 Electrifying boss fights<br>🎮 High replayability with multiple combat styles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\